#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:4
msgid "Direct and Manager MDP"
msgstr "直接式与管理器式 MDP"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:8
msgid ""
"A reinforcement learning task defines a Markov decision process (MDP): the "
"actions an agent can take, the observations it receives, its rewards, and "
"when an episode ends. In Isaac Lab, you can write this logic directly in an "
"environment class or assemble it from terms coordinated by managers."
msgstr ""
"强化学习任务定义一个马尔可夫决策过程（MDP）：智能体可以采取的动作、接收的观测、获得的奖励，以及回合结束条件。在 Isaac Lab "
"中，既可直接在环境类中编写这些逻辑，也可通过管理器协调各个项来组装任务。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:13
msgid ""
"Both approaches use Isaac Lab's simulation, scene, assets, and sensors. The "
"choice is how you organize the task code; it does not select a physics "
"backend."
msgstr "两种方式都使用 Isaac Lab 的仿真、场景、资产和传感器。区别在于如何组织任务代码，不决定物理后端的选择。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:18
msgid "Choosing an approach"
msgstr "如何选择"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:25
msgid "Direct"
msgstr "直接"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:26
msgid "Manager-based"
msgstr "基于管理器"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:27
msgid "Task logic"
msgstr "任务逻辑"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:28
msgid "Implement methods on an environment class."
msgstr "在环境类中实现方法。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:29
msgid "Configure reusable terms; managers run them."
msgstr "配置可复用的项，由管理器执行。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:30
msgid "Changing a task"
msgstr "修改任务"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:31
msgid "Edit the methods and helpers that implement its behavior."
msgstr "编辑实现任务行为的方法及辅助函数。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:32
msgid "Add, replace, or tune terms in its configuration."
msgstr "在配置中添加、替换或调整各个项。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:33
msgid "A good fit"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:34
msgid "Closely coupled logic, custom optimization, or multi-agent tasks."
msgstr "逻辑耦合紧密、需要自定义优化或多智能体的任务。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:35
msgid "Tasks that share observations, rewards, actions, or reset behavior."
msgstr "多个任务共用观测、奖励、动作或重置行为。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:37
msgid ""
"For a new single-agent task, manager-based environments are a useful "
"starting point: you can reuse existing terms and add your own where needed. "
"Choose direct when you prefer to keep the task logic together or need more "
"control over its implementation. Performance depends on the work your task "
"does, so profile before choosing a workflow for speed alone."
msgstr ""
"对于新的单智能体任务，基于管理器的环境是一个合适的起点：可以复用已有项，并按需添加自定义项。如果希望将任务逻辑集中编写，或需要更细致地控制实现，可选择直接工作流。性能取决于任务的具体计算工作，因此不要只凭速度判断工作流，应先做性能分析。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:45
msgid "Direct environments"
msgstr "直接工作流环境"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:47
msgid ""
"Subclass :class:`envs.DirectRLEnv` and implement the methods that define the"
" task. The base class handles the simulation loop and calls your methods at "
"the appropriate point in each step."
msgstr "继承 :class:`envs.DirectRLEnv`，并实现定义任务的方法。基类负责仿真循环，在每一步的相应位置调用这些方法。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:51
msgid ""
"Direct: one environment class defines actions, observations, rewards, "
"episode endings, and resets."
msgstr "直接工作流：由一个环境类定义动作、观测、奖励、回合结束条件和重置。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:55
msgid ""
"``_pre_physics_step()`` processes incoming actions; ``_apply_action()`` "
"applies them."
msgstr "``_pre_physics_step()`` 处理输入动作，``_apply_action()`` 施加动作。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:56
msgid ""
"``_get_observations()`` and ``_get_rewards()`` return observations and "
"rewards."
msgstr "``_get_observations()`` 和 ``_get_rewards()`` 分别返回观测与奖励。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:57
msgid ""
"``_get_dones()`` reports terminations and timeouts; ``_reset_idx()`` resets "
"selected environments."
msgstr "``_get_dones()`` 报告终止与超时，``_reset_idx()`` 重置选定环境。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:59
msgid ""
"Use :class:`envs.DirectRLEnvCfg` for the environment configuration. For "
"multi-agent tasks, use :class:`envs.DirectMARLEnv` and "
":class:`envs.DirectMARLEnvCfg`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`envs.DirectRLEnvCfg` 配置环境。多智能体任务使用 :class:`envs.DirectMARLEnv` 和 "
":class:`envs.DirectMARLEnvCfg`。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:62
msgid ""
"The methods can call shared helpers or optimized PyTorch or Warp code. "
"Keeping the task in one class does not mean every calculation must be "
"written inline. This structure is also familiar when porting tasks from "
"`IsaacGymEnvs`_ or `OmniIsaacGymEnvs`_."
msgstr ""
"这些方法可以调用共享的辅助函数，或经过优化的 PyTorch、Warp 代码。将任务放在同一个类中，并不意味着所有计算都要内联编写。从 "
"`IsaacGymEnvs`_ 或 `OmniIsaacGymEnvs`_ 迁移任务时，这种结构也较为熟悉。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:0
msgid "Cartpole rewards: direct"
msgstr "Cartpole 奖励：直接工作流"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:70
msgid "Cartpole computes its reward in ``_get_rewards()``."
msgstr "Cartpole 在 ``_get_rewards()`` 中计算奖励。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:77
msgid ""
"The calculation lives in a separate, TorchScript-compiled "
"``compute_rewards()`` function."
msgstr "具体计算位于独立的 ``compute_rewards()`` 函数中，由 TorchScript 编译。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:85
msgid "Manager-based environments"
msgstr "基于管理器的环境"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:87
msgid ""
"Use :class:`envs.ManagerBasedRLEnv` with a "
":class:`envs.ManagerBasedRLEnvCfg` to assemble a task from configured terms."
" A term defines a piece of behavior, such as an observation or reward. Its "
"configuration selects the implementation and supplies parameters; the "
"corresponding manager coordinates execution and combines the results."
msgstr ""
"使用 :class:`envs.ManagerBasedRLEnv` 和 "
":class:`envs.ManagerBasedRLEnvCfg`，可通过配置项组装任务。每个项定义一部分行为，例如某个观测或奖励；其配置选择具体实现并提供参数，对应的管理器负责协调执行和汇总结果。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:92
msgid ""
"Manager-based: task configuration selects reusable terms coordinated by "
"action, observation, and reward managers."
msgstr "基于管理器的工作流：任务配置选择可复用的项，由动作、观测和奖励管理器协调执行。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:96
msgid ""
"For example, a reward manager evaluates reward terms and combines their "
"weighted contributions. An observation manager collects observation terms "
"into groups. Other managers handle actions, terminations, events such as "
"resets, commands, and curricula."
msgstr "例如，奖励管理器计算各奖励项并汇总其加权贡献，观测管理器将各观测项收集成组。其他管理器负责动作、终止条件、重置等事件、命令以及课程。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:101
msgid ""
"To change one part of the task, replace a term or adjust its parameters. The"
" same term can serve several tasks, and custom terms can contain whatever "
"calculation the task needs."
msgstr "需要修改任务的某一部分时，只需替换相应项或调整参数。同一个项可供多个任务复用，自定义项也可包含任务所需的任意计算。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:0
msgid "Cartpole rewards: manager-based"
msgstr "Cartpole 奖励：基于管理器的工作流"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:108
msgid ""
"Cartpole combines reward terms in ``RewardsCfg``. Each term specifies a "
"function, a weight, and any parameters the function needs."
msgstr "Cartpole 在 ``RewardsCfg`` 中组合奖励项。每个项指定函数、权重及函数所需参数。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:116
msgid ""
"For environments that do not need RL rewards and terminations, use "
":class:`envs.ManagerBasedEnv` with :class:`envs.ManagerBasedEnvCfg`."
msgstr ""
"对于不需要强化学习奖励和终止条件的环境，使用 :class:`envs.ManagerBasedEnv` 与 "
":class:`envs.ManagerBasedEnvCfg`。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:130
msgid "Where to go next"
msgstr "进一步阅读"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:132
msgid ""
"Build a task with the :ref:`direct <tutorial-create-direct-rl-env>` or "
":ref:`manager-based <tutorial-create-manager-rl-env>` tutorial."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`直接工作流 <tutorial-create-direct-rl-env>` 或 :ref:`基于管理器的工作流 <tutorial-"
"create-manager-rl-env>` 教程构建任务。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:134
msgid ""
"Follow the :ref:`SO-101 vial-placement tutorial <tutorial-so101-task>` for a"
" complete manager-based manipulation task, including its scene, MDP terms, "
"reset curriculum, and agent configuration."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SO-101 小瓶放置教程 <tutorial-so101-task>` 展示了一个完整的管理器式操作任务，包括场景、MDP "
"项、重置课程和智能体配置。"

#: source/concepts/task_workflows.rst:137
msgid ""
"See :doc:`reinforcement_learning` to connect a task to a training library."
msgstr "将任务接入训练库，参阅 :doc:`reinforcement_learning`。"
